   "body": "I'm forty seven years old , so I have aging skin. After about a week of using the toner pads , I noticed an overall smoothness in my skin. Definitely loving the even tone. I was skeptical at first because it's only a thirty day supply but you can use them every other day. On my off days , I used to watermelon toner from the bottle. Skin is looking fabulous. Took one star away bc i would perfer a bigger size ",
