   "body": "I've been using Glow Recipe products for a while now, and one thing I've struggled with is that so many products are geared towards oily or acne prone skin. There are products that unfortunately burn my dry, sensitive skin. So when I saw that there was another product being added to the lineup that was meant for the dry skinned girlie, I was thrilled! The formula of the toner is absolutely incredible, and the pads themselves are so soothing and cooling! I also love that the jar comes with tweezers so you aren't having to dig around in the jar to fish out the pads with your fingers! I like combining these with the Avacado Ceramide cleanser and serum, and the Plum Pump moisturizer for a soothed, hydrated complexion! ",
