   "body": "Maybe it was because I received the samples in single use envelopes but I found it messy to use these and I spilled the extra liquid all over :(  Also, I only received 2 boxes of samples so there were only 2 envelopes of each kind and while I’m happy to do the review, I do not think 2 uses are anywhere near enough to leave a DECENT REVIEW.  Anyways here we go:  \nI kept these on for like 15 minutes and I didn’t like how my skin felt after I first used these and rubbed everything in- I felt sticky or tacky and I don’t like that.  Usually, that feeling (in my experience anyways) means I’m going to start pilling if I rub my skin or use any other product and unfortunately I was right.  I only wanted to use a little bit of moisturizer and it just felt gross with all the pills of product.  I wound up having to wipe my face with a damp cloth to remove the ballies (pilling) and luckily some product did remain because my skin felt really nice and soft.  If I were to try these again (I wouldn’t buy them but…) I would maybe do less time on and follow the recommended time and I also wouldn’t try to use all the extra liquid product in the envelope.  Maybe that was the pilling issue.",
   "dateCreated": "2026-02-19T03:39:04.179Z",
   "dateUpdated": "2026-02-19T03:39:04.179Z",
   "helpfulCount": 2,
