 "reviewsSummary": {
  "body": "Customers say these toner pads feel instantly soothing and cooling on the skin, providing immediate hydration and a calming sensation. Many find them particularly effective for sensitive, dry, or irritated skin, noting they reduce redness and leave skin feeling soft, smooth, and bouncy. The pads stay in place well during use and don't slip around. Users appreciate the lightweight formula that absorbs without leaving sticky residue. Many reviews mention the pads work well under the eyes and help with puffiness. Several customers with sensitive skin conditions like eczema or rosacea report these pads calm their skin without irritation. The thin, soft texture is frequently praised, and many users plan to repurchase and incorporate them into their regular routines.",
